msgctxt "184"
msgid "(What the...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Son of a bitch... Never thought there'd be another stalker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"What the hell are you talking about? You're my target,\r\n"
"ya damn skinhead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "You...! You're...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Emi... These the guys who've been following you around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on a second there! This girl\r\n"
"hired me to track down a stalker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"It's true. I hired him to do the same thing you're doing,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "So that means..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Hey! Come on, guys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Hold it right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Daddy!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Hey! That pervert in glasses is the stalker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"I already told you, that's not the case! I'm Emi's father,\r\n"
"you big buffoon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"And this man's not a stalker, either. I hired him\r\n"
"to keep an eye on Emi, to make sure no suspicious\r\n"
"men were sniffing about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "So... who's the stalker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "I... don't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"These past three days, Emi's been approached by seventeen\r\n"
"people, including you people. Most of them have been street\r\n"
"barkers and the like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Wait, you were tracking stuff like that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"What father wouldn't!? And seven of the twelve shops\r\n"
"you've been to were restaurants! Don't you think you've been\r\n"
"eating too much lately?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Especially yesterday, when you ordered that enormous sundae!\r\n"
" Have you been getting enough exercise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"And those clothes! Don't you think that outfit is a bit\r\n"
"too revealing!? This is exactly why I'm so worried\r\n"
"about you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"I mean, the day before yesterday, a young man was hitting\r\n"
"on you! What if I hadn't noticed, and... Are you listening\r\n"
"to me, Emi!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"And I told you not to hang your underwear up to dry\r\n"
"outside! I mean, the whole world can see your laundry\r\n"
"hanging out there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Daddy, please! That's enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Emi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Hold on. Why do you know... that much about her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Because I follow her like a shadow. How else is she\r\n"
"going to stay safe in this city?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "For three days straight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Of course. I am her father, after all. I can't leave\r\n"
"her alone in this crazy city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Is there something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "I am so, so sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "It's not much, but please take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"I'm so sorry about this whole mess. My dad caused a whole\r\n"
"lot of trouble for all of you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Don't put this on me, sweetie! It's because of how reckless\r\n"
"you are. This is exactly why I told you that living alone\r\n"
"out here was a bad idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Well, just as long as everything's okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Of course everything's okay! You don't think I'd let\r\n"
"anything happen to my Emi, do you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Daddy! Why won't you stop doing this!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"I can't help it, sweetie! You know how I worry so much\r\n"
"about you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "That's no excuse!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Emi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "(Some people just can't let go of their kids.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Hey... What the hell do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "(Dammit. He spotted me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Yeah... I was curious about what you were doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "Hold on, you two!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "What's this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"I was really scared I was being stalked, and I wanted to\r\n"
"get this over with as quickly as possible, so I hired both\r\n"
"of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"Wait, you hired both of us to figure out if you were being\r\n"
"stalked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"Then your problem's solved! I just got a stalker to agree\r\n"
"to never come back to this town again! Everything's\r\n"
"said and done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Really!? Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "And I appreciate your help, too, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Here, for your trouble. Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"Oh, nothing... I just got that feeling again... That\r\n"
"someone's watching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"But never mind! I'm sure it's just my wild\r\n"
"imagination! Thanks for all the help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"(Can't help but still feel worried about her, but what else\r\n"
"can I do? I couldn't find anybody suspicious...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "(Dammit. I lost him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "(I better check in with Emi.)"
msgstr ""

